      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so if the solenoids and valves are checking out fine, could it be something more intermittent? like an electrical ghost or something that only shows up under specific loads? i'm trying to rule out if it's a hard mechanical failure or just some weird internal glitch causing the spikes.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
